    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300a\u7075\u5251\u5947\u7f18\u300bis an epic MMORPG action xianxia (immortal-martial) game masterpiece, featuring stunning scenery, exquisite graphics, a prolonged storyline, and intricate romantic entanglements. With its mirage-like cityscapes and mist-covered sacred mountains, the game perfectly captures the essence of traditional Chinese aesthetics. Set against a grand backdrop and intertwined with intricate plots, it poignantly revisits the epic tales of xianxia heroes and heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300b\u300b\u300b\u300b\u300bGame Features\u300a\u300a\u300a\u300a\u300a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Demonization System</strong>: After a character undergoes demonization, their combat power significantly increases, enabling more efficient monster-slaying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/b6cfeb7a782f2525a983d72a3a2a0a1e.poster.avif?t=1740450703\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/b6cfeb7a782f2525a983d72a3a2a0a1e.webm?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/b6cfeb7a782f2525a983d72a3a2a0a1e.mp4?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transformation System</strong>: Upon awakening, characters can gain a substantial boost in combat power and attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/70110192332183d6c72f182671b63a79.poster.avif?t=1740450703\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/70110192332183d6c72f182671b63a79.webm?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/70110192332183d6c72f182671b63a79.mp4?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Effortless Monster Slaying</strong>: Enjoy an ultra-satisfying experience as if cutting through grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/b42e65a5fa523a6f41891e7e0a9d3d10.poster.avif?t=1740450703\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/b42e65a5fa523a6f41891e7e0a9d3d10.webm?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/b42e65a5fa523a6f41891e7e0a9d3d10.mp4?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance System Arrives</strong>: Find your beloved him/her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/bb97051ed287a19e633e386b6edade46.poster.avif?t=1740450703\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/bb97051ed287a19e633e386b6edade46.webm?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/bb97051ed287a19e633e386b6edade46.mp4?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive Skills and Costumes for Characters</strong>: Make a dazzling debut with unique abilities and fashionable outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/4120af167d0d3bac6b02befd61a35728.poster.avif?t=1740450703\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/4120af167d0d3bac6b02befd61a35728.webm?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386890/extras/4120af167d0d3bac6b02befd61a35728.mp4?t=1740450703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
